# No em dash

Never use the Unicode em dash (`—`, U+2014) anywhere in this project: UI copy, docs, metadata, comments, README, JSON, or table placeholders.

Use a normal hyphen instead:

- Prose: ` - ` (space, hyphen, space)
- Titles: `Cubix - Beautifully designed components`
- Empty table cells: `-`

```tsx
// BAD
"Accessible, customizable and open source — built on React."

// GOOD
"Accessible, customizable and open source - built on React."
```
